istances can compress the information in a meaningful way to summarize connectivity patterns.\ndf['topological_frequency_sum'] = df[['F02[C-N]', 'F03[C-O]', 'F03[C-N]', 'F04[C-N]']].sum(axis=1)\nend"), with improvements -
